<title>ECUADOR: Ecuador's coffee export prices detailed.</title>
<headline>Ecuador's coffee export prices detailed.</headline>
<dateline>QUITO 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is a list of the minimum FOB reference prices for exporting 100-lb (45.36-kilo) sacks of Ecuadorean coffee, effective Jan 2 to 8:</p>
<p>	 Washed arabic....................$ 107.53</p>
<p>	 Natural arabic...................$  99.40</p>
<p>	 Robust natural...................$  46.68</p>
<p>	 Roasted and/or ground............$  86.91</p>
</text>
